<title>FINLAND: CASTRUM H1 LOSS NARROWS TO FIM 8.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>CASTRUM H1 LOSS NARROWS TO FIM 8.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end June,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss before extraordinaries, taxes    8.5 vs 12.9</p>
